":"Parameters"},"302":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"303":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#errors","content":"Errors"},"304":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","content":"Give a group a permission for your whole organization, by the permission's id or exact title. Everyone in the group has it straight away, and so does everyone in a group nested in it. Giving a group what it already has changes nothing. Access that comes with the kind of group, was given by your identity provider or another system, or is already given to Everyone can't be added again here. Giving Manage access lets people change who can do what. If the permission is CLI Access, the response says that once anyone in your organization has it, command line use is limited to people who have it, and that taking it away later does not undo that. For administrators."},"305":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#parameters","content":"| Name    | In   | Type   | Required | Description                              |\n| ------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `group` | path | string | yes      | The group's id, from the list of groups. |","table":"table-0"},"306":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#parameters","content":"| Name         | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                                                          |\n| ------------ | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `permission` | path | string | yes      | A permission's id from the list of permissions, or its exact title. The id is the stable handle and titles can change, so scripts should use the id. |","table":"table-0"},"307":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | ----------- |\n| `group` | object | yes      | The group.  |","table":"table-1"},"308":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type            | Required | Description                                             |\n| ------ | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `note` | string, or null | yes      | Something to know about this change, when there is one. |","table":"table-1"},"309":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type   | Required | Description     |\n| ---