s nothing. Access that comes with the kind of group, or was given by your identity provider or another system, can't be taken away here. A permission a group has only because Everyone has it can't be taken away from the group: change it on Everyone. For administrators."},"346":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove#parameters","content":"| Name    | In   | Type   | Required | Description                              |\n| ------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `group` | path | string | yes      | The group's id, from the list of groups. |","table":"table-0"},"347":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove#parameters","content":"| Name         | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                                                          |\n| ------------ | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `permission` | path | string | yes      | A permission's id from the list of permissions, or its exact title. The id is the stable handle and titles can change, so scripts should use the id. |","table":"table-0"},"348":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-remove#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | ----------- |\n| `group` | object | yes 