/2026-09-14/approvals-list#errors","content":"Errors"},"883":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","content":"What is waiting on you, newest first: approvals to decide, tasks to complete and forms to fill in. Ask for `requested_by_me` to see the ones you asked for instead, or `involving_me` for both, and use `kind` to see only one sort. One page comes back, at most 100, and there is no next page. When `complete` is `false`, narrow the request with `status`, `kind` or `lens`."},"884":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#parameters","content":"| Name   | In    | Type                              | Required | Description                                                                                                      |\n| ------ | ----- | --------------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `kind` | query | one of `approval`, `task`, `form` |          | Only this kind of request: `approval` to decide, `task` to complete or `form` to fill in. Defaults to all three. |","table":"table-0"},"885":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#parameters","content":"| Name   | In    | Type                                                  | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n| ------ | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `lens` | query | one of `to_decide`, `requested_by_me`, `involving_me` |          | `to_decide` is approvals waiting on you, `requested_by_me` is ones you asked for or that were raised on your behalf, and `involving_me` is both, and any you took part in. These cover tasks to complete and forms to fill in as well as approvals. With `to_decide`, a `status` other than `pending` returns everything you took part in. Defaults to `to_decide`. |","table":"table-0"},"886":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#parameters","content":"| Name    | In    | Type    | Required | Description                                    |\n| ------- | ----- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `limit` | query | integer |          | How many to return, up to 100. Defaults to 50. |","table":"table-0"},"887":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#parameters","content":"| Name     | In    | Type                                                                                       | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| -------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `status` | query | one of `pending`, `approved`, `rejected`, `completed`, `submitted`, `expired`, `cancelled` |          | Only requests in this state. `pending` is waiting for an answer, `approved` and `rejected` were decided, `completed` is a task that was done, `submitted` is a form that was filled in, `expired` ran out of time before anyone answered, and `cancelled` was withdrawn before it was answered. Defaults to `pending`. |","table":"table-0"},"888":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `complete` | boolean | yes      | `false` when more approvals may match than came back. There is no next page; narrow the request with `status` or `lens`. The service filters after it applies the limit, so a short page is usually the whole list, but an approval that has more than one step can make it look shorter than it is. |","table":"table-1"},"889":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type           | Required | Description                             |\n| ------- | -------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `items` | list of object | yes      | One page of approvals, tasks and forms. |","table":"table-1"},"890":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-11","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#response-200","content":"An approval in a list."},"891":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-12","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type    | Required | Description                               |\n| ------------ | ------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `can_decide` | boolean | yes      | Whether you can approve or reject it now. |","table":"table-2"},"892":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-13","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type                        | Required | Description                   |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `created_at` | string (date-time), or null | yes      | When the approval was raised. |","table":"table-2"},"893":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type                        | Required | Desc