-update-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update#request-body","content":"| Field             | Type            | Required | Description                                                                  |\n| ----------------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `marked_resolved` | object, or null |          | This queue's own rule for resolved tickets. `null` means the organization's. |","table":"table-1"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update#request-body","content":"| Field                 | Type             | Required | Description                                                                                                                                             |\n| --------------------- | ---------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `max_open_per_person` | integer, or null |          | A recorded setting for the most open tickets one operator is handed at a time. Automatic assignment does not enforce it. `null` means none is recorded. |","table":"table-1"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/queues-update#request-body","content":"| Field  | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                |\n| ------ | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `name` | string |          | What this queue is called in the product. No other queue that is not archived may have it. |","table":"table-1"},"2153":{"i