` | object, or null |          | Who the ticket is for. |","table":"table-1"},"2682":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type                        | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |\n| --------- | --------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `routing` | one of `pending`, `settled` | yes      | Fixed values: `settled` once the ticket has a stored queue and a stored `state`, `pending` until then, while automatic routing may still change the queue, state or priority. A ticket just filed can show `state: open` while `routing` is still `pending`. |","table":"table-1"},"2683":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get#response-200","content":"| Field           | Type   | Required | Description                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `service_level` | object | yes      | When a reply and a resolution are due, as the ticket's queue sets them. |","table":"table-1"},"2684":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-get#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type            | Required | Descriptio