e says, then send it again. |","table":"table-2"},"3028":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list#errors","content":"| Code            | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                                |\n| --------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `SCOPE_MISSING` | 403         | Your connection was not granted access to this kind of action. Reconnect and grant it. |","table":"table-2"},"3029":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list#errors","content":"| Code              | HTTP status | Meaning                                                          |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `UNAUTHENTICATED` | 401         | You are not signed in, or your token has expired. Sign in again. |","table":"table-2"},"3030":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list-19","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list#errors","content":"| Code          | HTTP status | Meaning                                                  |\n| ------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `UNAVAILABLE` | 503         | The service is temporarily unavailable. Try again later. |","table":"table-2"},"3031":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list-20","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list#errors","content":"| Code                | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                              |\n| ------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `VALIDATION_FAILED` | 422         | Part of the request is not valid. Correct what the response names and send it again. |","table":"table-2"},"3032":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list-21","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-states-list#errors","content":"| Code              | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `VERSION_UNKNOWN` | 400         | This API does not serve the version you asked for. Send one of the dates in published_versions. |","table":"table-2"},"3033":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","type":"page","content":"Move a ticket","breadcrumbs":["Docs","API reference","2026-09-14","Tickets"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition"},"3034":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-0","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","content":"POST /tickets/{ticket}:transition"},"3035":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-1","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#parameters","content":"Parameters"},"3036":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"Request body"},"3037":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"3038":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#errors","content":"Errors"},"3039":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","content":"Move a ticket the way an operator would. Every move accepts a reason the requester can read. A hold pauses the response-time clocks. It can also name a person to hand to, a return date and a reminder. A refused move answers with the moves this caller can make."},"3040":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#parameters","content":"| Name     | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                  |\n| -------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `ticket` | path | string | yes      | The ticket id people see in the product, such as `ACME-042`. |","table":"table-0"},"3041":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"What moving a ticket accepts."},"3042":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"| Field    | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                              |\n| -------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reason` | string |          | Explanation for the move. Posted as a comment the requester can read. Required when moving to `on_hold`. |","table":"table-1"},"3043":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"| Field | Type             | Required | Description                |\n| ----- | ---------------- | -------- | -------------------------- |\n| `to`  | object or object | yes      | Where to move this ticket. |","table":"table-1"},"3044":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"Move to `on_hold`, with optional hold details."},"3045":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-11","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                      |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `delegate` | string, or null |          | Hand the ticket to this person: `me` for yourself, or the person's stable id. Omit to keep any earlier delegate. |","table":"table-2"},"3046":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-12","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"| Field        | Type                        | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `hold_until` | string (date-time), or null |          | Reminders to the person the ticket is handed to wait until this time, with a time zone offset. The ticket stays on hold until someone moves it. Omit to keep any time already set. |","table":"table-2"},"3047":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-13","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"| Field            | Type             | Required | Description                                                                                                               |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reminder_hours` | integer, or null |          | Remind the person the ticket is handed to after this many hours without activity on it. Omit to keep any earlier setting. |","table":"table-2"},"3048":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"| Field   | Type             | Required | Description       |\n| ------- | ---------------- | -------- | ----------------- |\n| `state` | always `on_hold` | yes      | Always `on_hold`. |","table":"table-2"},"3049":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-15","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"Move to any state other than `on_hold`."},"3050":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#request-body","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description                   |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `state` | string | yes      | Slug of the state to move to. |","table":"table-3"},"3051":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description           |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------- |\n| `assignee` | object, or null |          | Who is working on it. |","table":"table-4"},"3052":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field               | Type            | Required | Description                             |\n| ------------------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `available_actions` | object, or null |          | What this caller may do to this ticket. |","table":"table-4"},"3053":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-19","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type               | Required | Description                |\n| ------------ | ------------------ | -------- | -------------------------- |\n| `created_at` | string (date-time) | yes      | When the ticket was filed. |","table":"table-4"},"3054":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-20","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type            | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `description` | string, or null |          | The full text of the request, in plain text. |","table":"table-4"},"3055":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-21","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ----------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `followers` | list of object |          | People who follow this ticket. A follower can read the ticket and hears about its changes. The requester and the assignee always follow it. People who have left the organization are not listed. |","table":"table-4"},"3056":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-22","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                        |\n| ------ | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `hold` | object, or null |          | Who has the ticket while it is on hold, when reminders to them start and after how much quiet. Empty unless the ticket is on hold. |","table":"table-4"},"3057":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-23","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                              |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The ticket id people see in the product. |","table":"table-4"},"3058":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-24","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                     |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `priority` | string, or null |          | Slug of this ticket's priority. |","table":"table-4"},"3059":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-25","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                   | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------- | ---------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `queue` | string (uuid), or null |          | Identifier of the queue this ticket sits in. |","table":"table-4"},"3060":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-26","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type            | Required | Description            |\n| ----------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| `requester` | object, or null |          | Who the ticket is for. |","table":"table-4"},"3061":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-27","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type                        | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |\n| --------- | --------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `routing` | one of `pending`, `settled` | yes      | Fixed values: `settled` once the ticket has a stored queue and a stored `state`, `pending` until then, while automatic routing may still change the queue, state or priority. A ticket just filed can show `state: open` while `routing` is still `pending`. |","table":"table-4"},"3062":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-28","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field           | Type   | Required | Description                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `service_level` | object | yes      | When a reply and a resolution are due, as the ticket's queue sets them. |","table":"table-4"},"3063":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-29","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `state` | string, or null |          | Slug of the state this ticket is in. A new ticket has none until routing opens it; the response that files it shows `open` ahead of that. Routing can still move it, and a ticket that routing could not open stays without one, so get the ticket again to see where it settled. |","table":"table-4"},"3064":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-30","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `synced_from` | string, or null |          | The other system this ticket is linked to. Known values: `freshservice`, `jira`, `servicenow`; `external` for a system not listed. |","table":"table-4"},"3065":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-31","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description                      |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `title` | string | yes      | One-line summary of the request. |","table":"table-4"},"3066":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-32","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type               | Required | Description                   |\n| ------------ | ------------------ | -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `updated_at` | string (date-time) | yes      | When the ticket last changed. |","table":"table-4"},"3067":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-33","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type            | Required | Description                                                                    |\n| --------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `web_url` | string, or null |          | Link that opens this ticket in the web app. Null when the link can't be built. |","table":"table-4"},"3068":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-34","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"A person, as they appear in a response."},"3069":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-35","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type   | Required | Description                                     |\n| -------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `display_name` | string | yes      | How this person's name is shown in the product. |","table":"table-5"},"3070":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-36","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                      |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | This person's stable id. Pass it as `assignee`, `delegate`, in `followers` or as a people path to refer to them. |","table":"table-5"},"3071":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-37","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"What this caller may do to this ticket, right now."},"3072":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-38","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field             | Type           | Required | Description                                   |\n| ----------------- | -------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `editable_fields` | list of string | yes      | Fields this caller can change on this ticket. |","table":"table-6"},"3073":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-39","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type           | Required | Description                                 |\n| ------------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `transitions` | list of string | yes      | States this caller can move this ticket to. |","table":"table-6"},"3074":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-40","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"A person, as they appear in a response."},"3075":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-41","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type   | Required | Description                                     |\n| -------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `display_name` | string | yes      | How this person's name is shown in the product. |","table":"table-7"},"3076":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-42","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                      |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | This person's stable id. Pass it as `assignee`, `delegate`, in `followers` or as a people path to refer to them. |","table":"table-7"},"3077":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-43","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"Who has a ticket on hold, when reminders to them start, and after how much quiet."},"3078":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-44","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                    |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `delegate` | object, or null | yes      | The person the ticket was handed to while it is on hold. They are the one reminded. Empty when no one was named, or when the person has left the organization. |","table":"table-8"},"3079":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-45","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field            | Type             | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `reminder_hours` | integer, or null | yes      | How many hours the ticket can go without activity before the delegate is reminded. New activity starts the count again. Empty when this ticket has no setting of its own, which means the queue's setting applies. |","table":"table-8"},"3080":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-46","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                        | Required | Description                                                                                                                                         |\n| ------- | --------------------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `until` | string (date-time), or null | yes      | Reminders to the delegate wait until this time. The ticket stays on hold after it, until someone moves it on. Empty when reminders are not delayed. |","table":"table-8"},"3081":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-47","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"A person, as they appear in a response."},"3082":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-48","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type   | Required | Description                                     |\n| -------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `display_name` | string | yes      | How this person's name is shown in the product. |","table":"table-9"},"3083":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-49","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                      |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | This person's stable id. Pass it as `assignee`, `delegate`, in `followers` or as a people path to refer to them. |","table":"table-9"},"3084":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-50","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"The ticket's service level clock: when a reply and a resolution are due."},"3085":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-51","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type    | Required | Description