ckets-update#request-body","content":"| Field    | Type                  | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| -------- | --------------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `remove` | list of string (uuid) |          | People to remove, by their stable id. Anyone can remove themselves. Removing someone else needs someone who works this ticket's queue. The requester and the assignee can't be removed. |","table":"table-2"},"3195":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description           |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------- |\n| `assignee` | object, or null |          | Who is working on it. |","table":"table-3"},"3196":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-19","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field               | Type            | Required | Description                             |\n| ------------------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `available_actions` | object, or null |          | What this caller may do to this ticket. |","table":"table-3"},"3197":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-20","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type               | Required | Description                |\n| ------------ | ------------------ | -------- | -------------------------- |\n| `created_at` | string (date-time) | yes      | When the ticket was filed. |","table":"table-3"},"3198":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-21","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type            | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `description` | string, or null |          | The full text of the request, in plain text. |","table":"table-3"},"3199":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-22","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ----------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `followers` | list of object |          | People who follow this ticket. A follower can read the ticket and hears about its changes. The requester and the assignee always follow it. People who have left the organization are not listed. |","table":"table-3"},"3200":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-23","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                        |\n| ------ | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `hold` | object, or null |          | Who has the ticket while it is on hold, when reminders to them start and after how much quiet. Empty unless the ticket is on hold. |","table":"table-3"},"3201":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-24","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                              |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The ticket id people see in the product. |","table":"table-3"},"3202":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-25","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                     |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `priority` | string, or null |          | Slug of this ticket's priority. |","table":"table-3"},"3203":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-26","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                   | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------- | ---------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `queue` | string (uuid), or null |          | Identifier of the queue this ticket sits in. |","table":"table-3"},"3204":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-27","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type            | Required | Description            |\n| ----------- | --------------- | -------- | --