,"content":"| Field   | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `state` | string, or null |          | Slug of the state this ticket is in. A new ticket has none until routing opens it; the response that files it shows `open` ahead of that. Routing can still move it, and a ticket that routing could not open stays without one, so get the ticket again to see where it settled. |","table":"table-3"},"3208":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-31","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `synced_from` | string, or null |          | The other system this ticket is linked to. Known values: `freshservice`, `jira`, `servicenow`; `external` for a system not listed. |","table":"table-3"},"3209":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-32","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description                      |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `title` | string | yes      | One-line summary of the request. |","table":"table-3"},"3210":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-33","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type               | Required | Description                   |\n| ------------ | ------------------ | -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `updated_at` | string (date-time) | yes      | When the ticket last changed. |","table":"table-3"},"3211":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-34","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type            | Required | Description                                                                    |\n| --------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `web_url` | string, or null |          | Link that opens this ticket in the web app. Null when the link can't be built. |","table":"table-3"},"3212":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-35","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"A person, as they appear in a response."},"3213":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-36","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type   | Required | Description                                     |\n| -------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `display_name` | string | yes      | How this person's name is shown in the product. |","table":"table-4"},"3214":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-37","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                      |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | This person's stable id. Pass it as `assignee`, `delegate`, in `followers` or as a people path to refer to them. |","table":"table-4"},"3215":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-38","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"What this caller may do to this ticket, right now."},"3216":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-39","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field             | Type           | Required | Description                                   |\n| ----------------- | -------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `editable_fields` | list of string | yes      | Fields this caller can change on this ticket. |","table":"table-5"},"3217":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-40","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type           | Required | Description                                 |\n| ------------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `transitions` | list of string | yes      | States this caller can move this ticket to. |","table":"table-5"},"3218":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update-41","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-update#respons