n see or run it. Its schedules and triggers stop. Who it was shared with is cleared and its open review requests are closed, though that clean up can be left unfinished. Any workflow that calls it is turned off too, because it could not run without it. Runs already started carry on. Read what calls it before you delete it. Restoring a deleted workflow is not offered here. If the reply is lost, read the workflow: not found means it is deleted, or that you can no longer see it. Deleting a workflow that is already deleted reports it as not found."},"3302":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"3303":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description        |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------------ |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The workflow's id. |","table":"table-1"},"3304":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#errors","content":"A failed call answers with a problem body: a stable `code` to branch on, a `detail` for people, and `retryable`, which is advice for that one response."},"3305":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#errors","content":"| Code              | HTTP status | Meanin