es-list#parameters","content":"Parameters"},"3324":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"3325":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#errors","content":"Errors"},"3326":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","content":"The workflows a version calls, and the workflows that call this one from their published versions. Read it before deleting or turning off a workflow: those callers are turned off with it. Only workflows you can see are listed, so some callers may be missing, and the flags do not account for them. Deleted workflows are not listed in what a version calls. `calls_complete` and `callers_complete` say when what you can see may be short. The first 100 calls to the workflow are read, with no next page."},"3327":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"3328":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#parameters","content":"| Name      | In    | Type   | Required | Description                                                  |\n| --------- | ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `version` | query | string |          | The version to read. Leave it out for the published version. |","table":"table-0"},"3329":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ----------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `called_by` | list of object | yes      | Workflows that call this one, from their published versions, once for each version of this workflow they ask for. The first 100 calls to this workflow are read, and a workflow that calls it from two steps counts twice, so fewer callers may be listed. Only workflows you can see are listed. |","table":"table-1"},"3330":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field              | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                         