d for. Send one of the dates in published_versions. |","table":"table-3"},"3468":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","type":"page","content":"Give a person or group access to a workflow","breadcrumbs":["Docs","API reference","2026-09-14","Workflow access"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add"},"3469":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-0","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","content":"PUT /workflows/{workflow}/grants/{grantee_type}/{grantee}/{permission}"},"3470":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-1","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"Parameters"},"3471":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"3472":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add#errors","content":"Errors"},"3473":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","content":"Giving someone access to a workflow changes what they can do with it straight away. It does not tell them. Giving access that someone already has, whoever gave it, changes nothing and sends nothing. A group can be given view or run, and everyone in your organization only run, and the person must be in your organization. Anyone who can change who has access to a workflow can give themselves any access to it. For people who manage this workflow's access."},"3474":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"3475":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name           | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                               |\n| -------------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee_type` | path | string | yes      | `person` or `group`. Everyone in your organization is the group Everyone. |","table":"table-0"},"3476":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name      | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                 |\n| --------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee` | path | string | yes      | The person's id, or the group's id from the list of groups. |","table":"table-0"},"3477":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name         | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                              