 every cursor. Each says whether it is running, waiting on a person or finished, and how it ended. A run you can see only through its ticket is not listed, but you can read it by its id. Runs of a single action are not listed. A list reaches back at most 10,000 runs, so narrow it with `started_since` to go further. Whether a run is waiting is read live, so a run that is waiting can show as running when that could not be read."},"3818":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#parameters","content":"| Name      | In    | Type                                                                  | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n| --------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `outcome` | query | one of `succeeded`, `failed`, `canceled`, `abandoned`, `wait_expired` |          | Only runs that ended this way: `succeeded` finished its work, `failed` stopped with an error, `canceled` was stopped by a person, `abandoned` could not be followed to an end and `wait_expired` waited for a person or an outside event until the wait ran out. Runs that are still going are not listed. |","table":"table-0"},"3819":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#parameters","content":"| Name            | In    | Type                                | Required | Description                                                                         |\n| --------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `started_since` | query | string (date) or string (date-time) |          | Only runs that started at or after this time. A date means the start of it, in UTC. |","table":"table-0"},"3820":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#parameters","content":"| Name       | In    | Type   | Required | Description                 |\n| ---------- | ----- | ------ | -------- | --------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | query | string |          | Only runs of this workflow. |","table":"table-0"},"3821":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#parameters","content":"| Name     | In    | Type   | Required | Description                                                               |\n| -------- | ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cursor` | query | string |          | Where the next page starts: the `next_cursor` the previous page returned. |","table":"table-0"},"3822":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#parameters","content":"| Name    | In    | Type    | Required | Description                              |\n| ------- | ----- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `limit` | query | integer |          | How many results to return. At most 100. |","table":"table-0"},"3823":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type           | Required | Description           |\n| ------- | -------------- | -------- | --------------------- |\n| `items` | list of object | yes      | This page of results. |","table":"table-1"},"3824":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-11","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type            | Required | Description                                                       |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `next_cursor` | string, or null |          | Pass as `cursor` to fetch the next page. `null` on the last page. |","table":"table-1"},"3825":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-12","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"One run in a list."},"3826":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-13","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                              |\n| --------- | ------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `dry_run` | boolean | yes      | `true` for a dry run. A dry run simulates the actions that reach outside the workflow, so nothing there really happened. |","table":"table-2"},"3827":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description   |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The run's id. |","table":"table-2"},"3828":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-15","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type                                                                                                                                                   | Required | Description                             |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `origin` | one of `ask`, `slack`, `teams`, `ticket`, `ticket_event`, `event`, `mcp`, `editor`, `parent_workflow`, `schedule`, `api`, `other`, `unknown` or string | yes      | Where it was started from, as on a run. |","table":"table-2"},"3829":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                                               | Required | Description                                                                                                            |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `phase` | one of `pending`, `running`, `waiting`, `terminal` | yes      | `pending` when it has not started yet, `running` or `waiting` while it is under way, and `terminal` once it has ended. |","table":"table-2"},"3830":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type            | Required | Description                                                                     |\n| -------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `result` | object, or null | yes      | How it ended. `null` until it has ended, or when how it ended was not recorded. |","table":"table-2"},"3831":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type                        | Required | Description                                                             |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `started_at` | string (date-time), or null | yes      | When it started. `null` for runs that started before this was recorded. |","table":"table-2"},"3832":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-19","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type            | Required | Description                               |\n| -------- | --------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `ticket` | object, or null | yes      | The ticket it belongs to. `null` if none. |","table":"table-2"},"3833":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-20","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/wor