s-versions-get#parameters","content":"| Name      | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                |\n| --------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `version` | path | string | yes      | The version number, a whole number from 1. |","table":"table-0"},"3858":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type            | Required | Description                                                |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `change_note` | string, or null | yes      | What changed, when the author wrote it and you may see it. |","table":"table-1"},"3859":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type           | Required | Description                          |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `inputs` | list of object | yes      | What a run of this version asks for. |","table":"table-1"},"3860":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-versions-get#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type                        | Required | Description                                                                |\n| -------------- | --------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `published_at` | string (date-time), or null | yes      | When it went live. `null` for versions published before this was recorded. |","table":"