eading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"7525":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list-3","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list#errors","content":"Errors"},"7526":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list-4","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list","content":"Who can see, run or change a workflow: the people and groups given access to this workflow, and the access that covers every workflow in your organization. A person is shown by id, because their name is not part of the answer. Access given by someone else, or through a role, is listed too, with who gave it. You need view, edit or publish access to the workflow. A workflow you cannot see, or one that does not exist, is reported as not found."},"7527":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list-5","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"7528":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list-6","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-list#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type           | Required | Description                                                         |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grants` | list of object | yes      | Access given on this workflow alone. A grant can be one of several. |","table":"table-1"},